#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/ops/install.md:1 docs/ops/install.md:5 messages/po4a/en.xml:694
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Deploy FreeAnima on your machine — from source, or with a Linux standalone executable.\n"
"> After install: [`security.md`](security.md) (credentials, bind address) · [`database.md`](database.md) (PostgreSQL) · [`service.md`](service.md) (runtime commands) · [`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md) (Service API Token / LAN).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/install.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a path"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Path           | Best for                                  | Bun on host | PostgreSQL  | Redis                  | Secrets                            |\n"
"| -------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----------- | ----------- | ---------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Source**     | Contributors, day-to-day development      | Required    | You install | Optional (recommended) | Bootstrap: `env()`; runtime: Vault |\n"
"| **Standalone** | Production / self-host without a checkout | Not needed  | You install | Optional (recommended) | Bootstrap: `env()`; runtime: Vault |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:18
msgid ""
"Both paths run the same `anima service` runtime (Habitat REST `/api` + "
"Habitat RPC `/rpc/v1` + engine). PostgreSQL with **pgvector** is "
"**required**. Redis powers EventBus and task context; it **degrades "
"silently** when unavailable — production setups should still run it."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/install.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shared prerequisites"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Component      | Version / notes                                                                                                                                           |\n"
"| -------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Bun**        | >= 1.3.14 — required for **source** installs ([bun.sh](https://bun.sh)); not required for standalone binaries                                             |\n"
"| **PostgreSQL** | 17 recommended; extensions: `vector`, FTS helpers — see [`database.md`](database.md)                                                                      |\n"
"| **Redis**      | 7.x recommended; defaults to `127.0.0.1:6379` when configured                                                                                             |\n"
"| **Vault**      | Recommended for runtime secrets after Habitat is up; bootstrap `config.yaml` uses `env()` only ([`security.md`](security.md#credential-responsibilities)) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:29
msgid ""
"Data directory: `~/.anima/` (override with `FREEANIMA_HOME`). Back it up "
"with your database."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/install.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Standalone (Linux x64)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:35
msgid ""
"Release publishes 三端产物（与 canary 对称）：`anima-linux-x64.tar.gz`、"
"`freeanima-desktop-windows-x64-setup.exe`、`freeanima-mobile-android.apk`"
"（CI 固定 upload 签名；本地 `just dev tauri-android` 仍为默认 debug 签名）。"
"Standalone tarball 内含单文件可执行文件 `anima`；版本、service build-meta、"
"migrations 与 Web UI 均嵌入该二进制。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ops/install.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Install (recommended)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -fsSL https://freeanima.com/install | bash\n"
"anima --version   # e.g. 0.8.5 (standalone) · release\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:44
msgid "Canary（`main` 滚动 Pre-release tag `canary`）或 pin 版本："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -fsSL https://freeanima.com/install | CHANNEL=canary bash\n"
"curl -fsSL https://freeanima.com/install | VERSION=v0.8.5 bash\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:51
msgid ""
"国内网络可指定公共 GitHub 反代（`PROXY=none|ghproxy-net|gh-proxy-com|ghfast-"
"top`，默认 `none`）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -fsSL https://freeanima.com/install | PROXY=ghproxy-net bash\n"
"curl -fsSL https://freeanima.com/install | CHANNEL=canary PROXY=ghfast-top bash\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:58
msgid ""
"可选环境变量：`FREEANIMA_INSTALL_PREFIX`（默认 `~/.anima/standalone`）、"
"`FREEANIMA_HOME`（默认 `~/.anima`，数据目录）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:60
msgid "备用（不依赖站点发布）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/main/scripts/install.sh | bash\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install prefix keeps versioned binaries as `anima_<version>` plus an `anima` symlink to the current version (up to 7 versions retained). Do not unpack into a git checkout. Ensure `~/.local/bin` is on `PATH`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:68
msgid "Manual unpack (same layout as the installer):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:69
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir -p ~/.anima/standalone && cd ~/.anima/standalone\n"
"tar -xzf /path/to/anima-linux-x64.tar.gz\n"
"# assume extracted file is ./anima — rename to versioned file then link\n"
"mv anima anima_0.9.2\n"
"ln -sfn anima_0.9.2 anima\n"
"mkdir -p ~/.local/bin && ln -sfn \"$PWD/anima\" ~/.local/bin/anima\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:79
msgid ""
"Or from a checkout: `just install cli` (builds then installs to the same "
"default prefix)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:81
msgid "Installed standalone 可用内置升级换轨与本机版本切换："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima upgrade --channel canary   # 跟随 canary tip\n"
"anima upgrade --channel release  # 切回稳定轨 tip\n"
"anima versions                   # 列出本机 anima_*（* = current）\n"
"anima versions use 0.9.2         # 切换 current symlink\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Mobile Android APK**（`freeanima-mobile-android.apk`）：从 GitHub Release（`canary` 或版本 tag）下载 sideload。CI 使用固定 upload 签名，同 channel 内可覆盖升级。若曾安装旧版未固定签名的包，或密钥轮换后，需先卸载 `FreeAnima`（`org.freeanima.app`）再安装。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ops/install.md:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Configure"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:93
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir -p ~/.anima\n"
"chmod 700 ~/.anima\n"
"# copy config.example.yaml from the repo, or write manually\n"
"cp /path/to/freeanima-checkout/config.example.yaml ~/.anima/config.yaml\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:101
msgid ""
"Minimum production settings in `~/.anima/config.yaml` (**bootstrap only**):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/install.md:104
msgid "**`database.url`** — PostgreSQL connection string (required)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/install.md:104
msgid ""
"**`web.enabled`** — Habitat hosts `/web/*` when dist exists (optional; "
"defaults to on if omitted)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Runtime settings** (LLM providers, compression, MCP, etc.) are stored in PostgreSQL (`habitat_runtime_config`). Edit them in the Shell app under **Settings → Habitat 服务 → 服务配置**.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:108
msgid ""
"Prefer `env()` for bootstrap secrets in `config.yaml` (Vault is unavailable "
"before PostgreSQL). Use Vault / `vault()` for runtime secrets in PG. See "
"[`security.md`](security.md#credential-responsibilities)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ops/install.md:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Start the service"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:111
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima service start              # background (systemd user unit when available)\n"
"anima service start --foreground # debug — logs to stdout\n"
"anima service status\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:118
msgid ""
"Default bind: `127.0.0.1:2658`（Habitat API：`/api`，Habitat RPC：`/rpc/v1`；"
"Web UI：`/web/*` when `config.yaml` `web.enabled`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ops/install.md:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Upgrade"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:122
msgid "Installed standalone (independent prefix, e.g. `~/.anima/standalone`):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:123
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima upgrade                 # 当前 bake channel 内升级（release：semver；canary：commit）\n"
"anima upgrade --check\n"
"anima upgrade --channel canary   # 切到 / 检查 canary tip\n"
"anima upgrade --proxy ghproxy-net\n"
"anima upgrade --check --channel canary --proxy ghfast-top\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:132
#, no-wrap
msgid "升级时 Habitat 在**下载与校验阶段保持在线**；若 service 原先在运行，仅在替换二进制瞬间短暂停服并自动拉起。未运行 service 时仅写入新的 `anima_<version>` 并切换 `anima` symlink，不会自动启动。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:133
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima service restart   # 手动升级二进制后若未自动拉起时使用\n"
"anima versions use <id> # 回退到本机已保留的旧版本（同样会按需停/启 service）\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:139
msgid ""
"Re-run the curl installer to reinstall/overwrite the same prefix, or from a "
"checkout rebuild and reinstall (never into the repo):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:140
#, no-wrap
msgid "just install cli\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:145
msgid "`dist/anima-executable/` is build staging only — not a runtime prefix."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ops/install.md:146
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build from a checkout"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:149
msgid ""
"Always runs `just pack web` before compiling the binary (embeds current Web "
"dist):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:150
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"just pack cli\n"
"# → dist/anima-executable/ (staging)\n"
"just install cli\n"
"# → ~/.anima/standalone/anima_<version> + anima symlink + ~/.local/bin/anima\n"
"anima --version\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:159
msgid ""
"Override prefix: `FREEANIMA_INSTALL_PREFIX=/opt/freeanima just install cli` "
"or `bun scripts/install-cli.ts --prefix /opt/freeanima --skip-build`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/install.md:162
#, no-wrap
msgid "Source (repository)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:165
msgid "For development, unreleased fixes, or running from a git checkout."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ops/install.md:166
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Clone and install dependencies"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:169
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Prerequisites:** Bun >= 1.3.14 · PostgreSQL (pgvector) · Redis (recommended) · Vault (recommended) · [just](https://github.com/casey/just) (for `just install cli`)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:170
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima.git\n"
"cd freeanima\n"
"bun install\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ops/install.md:176
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Run the CLI from the checkout"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:179
msgid ""
"Do **not** symlink source `cli.ts` into a global bin. From the checkout:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:180
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bun src/app/cli/cli.ts -- --help\n"
"just dev\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:186
msgid ""
"To install a **standalone** binary into an independent prefix (default "
"`~/.anima/standalone`) for a PATH `anima` command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:187
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"just install cli\n"
"# ensure ~/.local/bin is on PATH\n"
"anima --version\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ops/install.md:193
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Configure and start"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:195
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir -p ~/.anima\n"
"cp config.example.yaml ~/.anima/config.yaml\n"
"# configure database + LLM (see database.md, security.md)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:202
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Dev** (Habitat + Vite HMR; never auto-builds Web). Prefer `just dev` for multi-worktree:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:203
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"just dev            # Habitat random ≥10000 + Web from :5000; FREEANIMA_URL wires Vite proxy only\n"
"# or two terminals:\n"
"just dev habitat     # random ≥10000 (not production 2658); writes ~/.anima/dev-web.token\n"
"FREEANIMA_URL=http://127.0.0.1:<habitat-port> just dev web   # default :5000; browser Habitat = page origin\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:211
msgid ""
"Browser Web defaults Habitat URL to the **page origin** (same in production "
"Habitat-hosted `/web` and Vite). Dev injects Service API Token from `dev-"
"web.token` automatically. If `http.tls.enabled` / `DEV_HTTPS=1`, Vite serves "
"HTTPS using `~/.anima/tls` (Habitat stays plain HTTP). Source `just dev "
"habitat` also **ignores** `config.yaml` `web.enabled` / `web.host` / "
"`web.port` — Habitat does not host `/web` dist; use Vite (`WEB_DEV_PORT`, "
"default 5000)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:213
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Source deploy** (Habitat hosts `/web/*` when `config.yaml` `web.enabled`): build Web first, then start — startup does not run `just pack web`. Source-tree `anima` has no `service` command.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:214
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"just pack web\n"
"just dev habitat\n"
"# UI: http://127.0.0.1:2658/web/chat\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ops/install.md:220
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Development checks"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:222
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"just check    # typecheck + lint + format + changed unit tests\n"
"just test     # full unit + integration (integration may use Docker for temp PG)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:228
msgid ""
"Upgrade manually: `git pull`, `bun install`, then restart the service. "
"`anima upgrade` / `/upgrade` print instructions only."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/install.md:231
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify installation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:234
msgid ""
"Requires the **standalone** `anima` binary (`anima service` is not on the "
"source-tree CLI)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/install.md:235
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima service start\n"
"anima token create --subject-id 1 --name bootstrap\n"
"# 将输出的 fa_at_... 填入客户端 Habitat 设置\n"
"\n"
"anima service status\n"
"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer <fa_at_...>\" http://127.0.0.1:2658/rpc/v1/status/get | jq '.version, .memory_kb'\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/install.md:245
msgid ""
"If status fails, check PostgreSQL connectivity, that migrations completed "
"([`database.md`](database.md#troubleshooting)), and that a valid Service API "
"Token is configured."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/install.md:246
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/ops/install.md:252
msgid ""
"**Security** — bootstrap `env()` + runtime Vault, `chmod 700 ~/.anima`, do "
"not expose Habitat without auth ([`security.md`](security.md))"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/ops/install.md:252
msgid ""
"**Remote access** — Service API Token + LAN / local HTTPS for personal "
"mobile/remote Habitat ([`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md))"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/ops/install.md:252
msgid ""
"**Database** — backups, extensions, manual migrations if needed "
"([`database.md`](database.md))"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/ops/install.md:252
msgid ""
"**Operations** — start/stop, memory metrics ([`service.md`](service.md))"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/ops/install.md:252
msgid ""
"**Architecture** — memory pipeline, self layer, tools ([`../concepts/"
"architecture.md`](../concepts/architecture.md))"
msgstr ""
